# KDA fused chunk-recurrence — patch sketch (P11 obligations honored by verbatim transplant)
# Applies conceptually to: include/insignia_glm53.cuh, src/glm53_ops.cu, src/glm53_generate.cu
# NOT applied anywhere by this session (hard rule: no src/ modifications). Senior-implementer sketch.
# Every expression marked VERBATIM is a character-exact transplant from the existing kernels
# (modulo the named pointer/index substitutions); barrier placement is transplanted with them.

